      <p>In this regard, for the promotion of joint projects between the two countries, the formation of a Pakistan-Iran joint investment company, the provision of visas to Pakistani traders from Iranian diplomatic missions as needed, and the agreement on preferential tariffs by both countries to promote imports and exports are actions in which further improvement is being seen. We should also hope that in the coming days, the existing trade relations will see significant increase and growth.</p>
