      <p>While this same social media is bent on destroying the morals of our children, suddenly such unethical images or advertisements appear on mobile phones or computers that destroy children's morals. Today, we don't have platforms like Facebook, YouTube, Twitter; they are all controlled by outsiders. If you say something slightly against their temperament, you are kicked out. The biggest fault is our own: we have handed over all technology to outsiders. It is no secret what conditions our great Muslim scientists have faced in Muslim monarchies.</p>
