        <li>"Quds Day is not exclusive to Palestine; it is the day of Islam; it is the day of the Islamic government. It is a day when the flag of the Islamic Republic should be raised in all countries. It is a day when the superpowers should be made to understand that they can no longer advance into Islamic countries. It is the day when we must unite all our strengths; and Muslims must come out of their shells and stand before outsiders and strangers with all their might and power."</li>
