      <p>But look, Allah has also taken Suo Moto action. You remained silent on the oppression in Palestine, Kashmir, Yemen, Syria, Iraq, Burma, and other Muslims. You remained silent on the lockdowns imposed on these Muslims, so why not impose a lockdown on the whole world? And thus, the freedom of the whole world was taken away by a small creature of God (the coronavirus). If this is not Allah's displeasure, what else is it that the Kaaba, the Prophet's Mosque, and sacred places have been closed to Muslims today? Now it is also being said that this corona is just a small blast; now a bigger blast is about to happen, under which the whole world will be controlled in the name of vaccines. A chip will be implanted in people's bodies to control them, and without it, no one will be able to travel by air or access other facilities.</p>
