      <p>The issue of Palestine and our individual role. Muslims need to unite today more than ever before. Therefore, the entire Islamic world must think about this together. Ali (AS) says: "If a poor person is dying of hunger, a rich person has usurped his right." Similarly, if Muslims are being oppressed somewhere, are we not at fault?</p>
