      <p>The hypocritical attitude of global colonialism and Arab rulers. Every Palestinian youth bathed in blood, or every Palestinian family left without a guardian and whose family is scattered, involves the direct hand of the American government and its president, who share in this crime. If anyone expresses sympathy with any group of Muslims and speaks of the good of humanity in the name of God and His Prophet, the standard for verifying their claim is their words and actions on the issue of Palestine.</p>
